B.ahp=new A.fF("1. Who is responsible","Tactivo Limited, company number 17373279, registered in England & Wales at 63 Carlton Road, Erith, DA8 1DX, United Kingdom, is the data controller for the information described here. Contact us at info@tactivo.co.uk about anything in this policy.")
B.ahs=new A.fF("2. What we collect","Your email address and password, which is stored scrambled so nobody \u2014 including us \u2014 can read it. Your profile: display name, username, and anything optional you choose to add such as a photo, bio, location, phone number, coaching role, qualification or experience. Your coaching content: session plans, saved and self-written drills, session dates, team settings, and the ratings and private notes you leave after a session. If you answer it, how you heard about Tactivo. When you open the app and when you sign in, the moment and your account are recorded \u2014 nothing else \u2014 so we can see whether Tactivo is being used.")
B.ahb=new A.fF("3. What we do not collect","Beyond the app-open and sign-in record above, Tactivo has no analytics tools, no tracking, no advertising and no third-party marketing tools of any kind. We do not record which screens you open or which features you use. We do not follow you across other apps or websites, we do not track your location, and we do not collect information about players or any other person. The app stores a sign-in token on your device so you stay signed in; it is not used to track you.")
B.ahe=new A.fF("4. Why we hold it","To give you the account and the app you asked for \u2014 building your sessions, keeping your library, and showing your season back to you. That is the contract between us. We also keep it secure, which is our legal obligation.")
B.ahr=new A.fF("5. Who else sees it","Your coaching content is private to your account. Other coaches cannot see your profile, your sessions or your notes. We use three suppliers to run the service: Supabase stores the database, your account and your photo, Resend sends the verification and password-reset emails, and OpenRouter runs the model described below. Supabase and Resend hold the data in Ireland. If you sign in with Google or Apple, that company confirms who you are and tells us your email address. We never sell your data.")
B.ahq=new A.fF("6. The one thing we send to an AI service",'When you describe a session in your own words \u2014 "midfield gets overrun" \u2014 that sentence is sent to OpenRouter, which runs a Google Gemini model, to work out which focuses you mean. That is all it does: it never picks your drills, which are chosen on your phone from the library built into the app.\n\nWe send the sentence and nothing else. Not your name, not your email, not your saved sessions, and nothing identifying your account. We do not keep the sentence afterwards; we record only how large the request was, so we can see what the service costs. If it is unavailable your session is still built, from the words your phone can read on its own.')
B.aht=new A.fF("7. How long we keep it","Until you delete your account. Deleting it in Settings removes your account, profile, photo, sessions, drills and notes from our live systems immediately; encrypted backups age out within 30 days. There is no recovery, so export anything you want to keep first.")
B.ahl=new A.fF("8. Your rights","You can ask for a copy of your data, correct it, delete it, or object to how we use it. Most of it you can see and change in the app; for anything else email info@tactivo.co.uk and we will respond within one month. If you are unhappy with our answer you can complain to the Information Commissioner's Office at ico.org.uk.")
